---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import Badge from '../../components/Badge.astro';
import Steps from '../../components/Steps.astro';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Quest 2.1 - Fix the Vague Prompt"
  description="Transform a vague prompt into a specific one"
  sidebar={true}
>
  <h1>Quest 2.1: Fix the Vague Prompt</h1>

  <p>
    <Badge text="🟢 Easy" variant="success" />
    <Badge text="15 minutes" variant="note" />
    <Badge text="Block 2: Prompt Engineering" variant="tip" />
  </p>

  <h2>🎯 Goal</h2>
  <p>เปลี่ยน vague prompt ให้เป็น specific prompt ที่ได้ผลลัพธ์ดี</p>

  <hr />

  <h2>📋 Instructions</h2>

  <Steps>
    <li>
      <strong>วิเคราะห์ bad prompt</strong>:
      <pre><code>{`Make a function that handles users`}</code></pre>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>หาว่าขาดอะไร</strong>:
      <ul>
        <li>"handle" หมายถึงอะไร?</li>
        <li>user data 有什么?</li>
        <li>validation ต้องการอะไร?</li>
        <li>return อะไร?</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>เขียน improved prompt</strong>:
      <pre><code>{`Create a function called createUser that:
- Takes { name: string, email: string }
- Validates email format
- Returns { success, id, name, email }`}</code></pre>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>ใช้ prompt กับ AI tool</strong>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>ทดสอบ generated code</strong>
    </li>
  </Steps>

  <hr />

  <h2>🎮 Code Playground</h2>

  <iframe
    src="https://stackblitz.com/edit/Poom5741-ai-sdlc-quests?embed=1&file=block-2-prompt-engineering/quest-04-fix-prompt/index.js&view=editor"
    style="width:100%;height:500px;border:0;border-radius:4px;"
    allow="cross-origin-isolation"
    title="Quest 2.1: Fix the Vague Prompt"
  />

  <hr />

  <h2>✅ Verification</h2>

  <pre><code class="language-bash">{`node test.js`}</code></pre>

  <hr />

  <h2>💡 Tips</h2>
  <p>A good prompt includes:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Function name and purpose</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Input parameters</strong> with types</li>
    <li><strong>Output format</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Validation rules</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Error handling</strong></li>
  </ol>
</DocLayout>
